To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool, follow these steps: 
Open Claude Desktop and go to Settings
Navigate to the MCP section
Add a new MCP server with these settings: 
Server Name: virtual-fly-brain (or any name you prefer)
Type: HTTP
Server URL: https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org

Alternatively, you can use the following Configuration JSON:
```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
